      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## Competitor Unhappy Customer Finder-n8n Workflow (Rakip Müşteri Bulma Otomasyonu)\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs on a schedule to find potentially unhappy customers from competitor review data. It starts an Apify actor with configured competitor company URLs, polls until the run succeeds, then pulls the scraped results. The results are transformed in JavaScript, passed through a second Apify/API step for enrichment or lookup, and finally processed into the workflow’s final lead output.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the Schedule Trigger with the desired run frequency.\n- Set the competitor company URLs and maxReviewsPerCompany values in the Config node.\n- Add valid Apify API credentials or tokens to all Apify HTTP Request nodes.\n- Verify the Apify actor IDs, run status endpoints, and dataset result URLs used in the HTTP Request nodes.\n- Review the JavaScript code nodes to ensure the output fields match the lead/customer format you need.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the competitor URL list, review limit, polling interval, maximum poll count, and JavaScript filtering logic to target different competitors, review volumes, or definitions of an unhappy customer."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
